                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Documentation of the dashboard can be found here: </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4996b2' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/DHPANA/Workplace+Attendance+Report&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/DHPANA/Workplace+Attendance+Report</run>
